Olga Lydia

Olga Lydia (#ALIH) ya iku salah sijiné &lt;a href="modh%C3%A9l"&gt;modhél&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="presenter"&gt;presenter&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="aktris"&gt;aktris&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; keturunan &lt;a href="Tionghoa"&gt;Tionghoa&lt;/a&gt;. Olga Lydia lulus saka &lt;a href="Fakultas%20Teknik%20Sipil"&gt;Fakultas Teknik Sipil&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Universitas%20Parahyangan"&gt;Universitas Parahyangan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bandung"&gt;Bandung&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; 1994. Olga Lydia dhuwure 171 cm, lan boboté 47 kg. Olga miwiti kariré dadi &lt;a href="modh%C3%A9l"&gt;modhél&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="catwalk"&gt;catwalk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="iklan%2C"&gt;iklan,&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="video%20klip"&gt;video klip&lt;/a&gt;.
Saliyané iku Olga Lydia uga tau tampil ing &lt;a href="video%20klip"&gt;video klip&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Boomerang"&gt;Boomerang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Stanley%20Sagala"&gt;Stanley Sagala&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kafein%2C"&gt;Kafein,&lt;/a&gt; lan uga &lt;a href="D%C3%A9wa"&gt;Déwa&lt;/a&gt;. Olga Lydia dadi presenter ing acara &lt;a href="Sisi%20Lain"&gt;Sisi Lain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jelita"&gt;Jelita&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Trans%20TV"&gt;Trans TV&lt;/a&gt;), Otomotif (&lt;a href="TV7"&gt;TV7&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="A1GP"&gt;A1GP&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Global%20TV"&gt;Global TV&lt;/a&gt;) (saiki disitarake ing &lt;a href="TV%20ONE"&gt;tvOne&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Dunia%20Samsung%2C"&gt;Dunia Samsung,&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="News%20dot%20Com"&gt;Republik Mimpi&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Metro%20TV"&gt;Metro TV&lt;/a&gt;).
Ing seni peran, jenéngé misuwur saka &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Lo%20Fen%20Koei"&gt;Lo Fen Koei&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="RCTI"&gt;RCTI&lt;/a&gt;) lan filem horror &lt;a href="12%20AM"&gt;12 AM&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané karir ing donyaning hiburan, Olga Lydia uga duwé &lt;a href="bisnis"&gt;bisnis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="studio"&gt;studio&lt;/a&gt; rekaman amatir lan &lt;a href="les"&gt;les&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="vokal"&gt;vokal&lt;/a&gt; 'Rumah Bintang', panggonan &lt;a href="bilyar"&gt;bilyar&lt;/a&gt; 'La Forca' lan &lt;a href="restoran"&gt;restoran&lt;/a&gt; 'Poke Sushi'. Saliyané iku, Olga Lydia uga dadi salah sijiné pengurus &lt;a href="Percasi"&gt;Percasi&lt;/a&gt;. Ing wiwitan taun 2006, nalika lagi moncér-moncéré isu pro lan kontra ngenani &lt;a href="RUU%20APP"&gt;RUU APP&lt;/a&gt;, Olga Lydia tampil dadi salah sijiné &lt;a href="artis"&gt;artis&lt;/a&gt; kang aktif nentang RUU iki. Awit RUU iki duwé potensi kanggo mendiskreditkan kaum hawa. Dhèwèké &lt;a href="foto"&gt;foto&lt;/a&gt; kanthi &lt;a href="fose"&gt;fose&lt;/a&gt; kang seksi ing &lt;a href="majalah"&gt;majalah&lt;/a&gt; wong &lt;a href="lanang"&gt;lanang&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nentang RUU iku.
