Sarah Meirizka Hardiany Sechan (#ALIH; luwih ditepungi kanthi jeneng Sarah Sechan) ya iku mantan &lt;a href="video%20jockey"&gt;video jockey&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="MTV"&gt;MTV&lt;/a&gt;. Saiki Sarah Sechan dadi &lt;a href="Wakil%20Pemimpin%20Redaksi"&gt;Wakil Pemimpin Redaksi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kalawarti"&gt;kalawarti&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Cosmo%20Girl"&gt;Cosmo Girl&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku Sarah Sechan uga dadi &lt;a href="pr%C3%A9s%C3%A8nter"&gt;présènter&lt;/a&gt; lan bintang &lt;a href="iklan"&gt;iklan&lt;/a&gt;.
Jeneng Sarah wiwit ditepungi publik nalika dhèwèké wiwit dadi VJ MTV. Sarah Sechan suksès lan éntuk bebungah &lt;a href="MTV%20Nokia%20Jukebox%20Music%20Is%20My%20Life"&gt;MTV Nokia Jukebox Music Is My Life&lt;/a&gt;. Sarah uga tau mimpin program &lt;a href="Kisah%20Di%20Antara%20Kita"&gt;Kisah Di Antara Kita&lt;/a&gt; kang disiyaraké déning &lt;a href="SCTV"&gt;SCTV&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika iku, dhèwèké dhuét karo &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; senior &lt;a href="Deddy%20Mizwar"&gt;Deddy Mizwar&lt;/a&gt;.
