Sarah Sechan palakrama karo &lt;a href="Emir%20Hakim"&gt;Emir Hakim&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké nikah ing &lt;a href="Masjid%20Sunda%20Kelapa"&gt;Masjid Sunda Kelapa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Menteng"&gt;Menteng&lt;/a&gt; nalika sasi &lt;a href="Juni"&gt;Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;. Sarah Sechan lan Emir Hakin nduwé anak kang jenéngé &lt;a href="Rajata"&gt;Rajata&lt;/a&gt;.
