Sheila on Seven (SO7), sawijining &lt;a href="grup"&gt;grup&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt; kang kondhang ning &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;, personilé &lt;a href="Akhdiyat%20Duta%20Modjo%20%28Sheila%20On%207%29"&gt;Duta&lt;/a&gt;
(&lt;a href="Akhdiyat%20Duta%20Modjo%20%28Sheila%20On%207%29"&gt;Akhdiyat Duta Modjo&lt;/a&gt;,vokal), &lt;a href="Eross%20Candra%20%28Sheila%20On%207%29"&gt;Eross&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Eross%20Candra%20%28Sheila%20On%207%29"&gt;Eross Candra&lt;/a&gt;, gitar),&lt;a href="Adam%20Muhammad%20Subarkah%20%28Sheila%20On%207%29"&gt;Adam&lt;/a&gt;
(&lt;a href="Adam%20Muhammad%20Subarkah%20%28Sheila%20On%207%29"&gt;Adam Muhammad Subarkah&lt;/a&gt;, bass).
&lt;a href="Grup"&gt;Grup&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt; iki jumeneng ning &lt;a href="Yogyakarta"&gt;Yogyakarta&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal 6 &lt;a href="M%C3%A8i"&gt;Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1996"&gt;1996&lt;/a&gt;, asliné duwé jeneng "Sheila Gank" kang dijukut saka tembung Sheila saka basa Celtic kang artiné musikal.
Jeneng iki uga pernah diowah dadi On Seven, kang tegesé pitu tangga nada ning &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt;.
SO7 (jeneng liya saka Sheila On 7), uga pernah ngalami pindah formasi.
Kaya nalika sasi &lt;a href="Oktober"&gt;Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brian%20Kresno%20Putro"&gt;Brian&lt;/a&gt; lumebu ngantikaké Anton kang ditokake amarga dianggep ora disiplin.
Lan nalika sasi &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, Sakti mundur kanggo golèk kawruh ning &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;.
Saka taun &lt;a href="1996"&gt;1996&lt;/a&gt;, Sheila on 7 ngewarnai indhustri musik Indonésia.
