Ali Sastroamidjojo

Ali Sastroamidjojo SH (&lt;a href="EYD"&gt;EYD&lt;/a&gt;: Ali Sastroamijoyo) (#ALIH) ya iku tokoh &lt;a href="pulitik"&gt;pulitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="papr%C3%A9ntahan"&gt;papréntahan&lt;/a&gt;, lan nasionalis. Panjenengané diwènèhi gelar Meester in de Rechten minangka (sarjana hukum) déning &lt;a href="Universitas%20Leiden"&gt;Universitas Leiden&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt;. Uga panjenengané dadi salah sijiné &lt;a href="Mahamantri%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Mahamantri Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; ka-8 kang njabat ing periode &lt;a href="1953"&gt;1953&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1955"&gt;1955&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Kabinet%20Ali%20Sastroamidjojo%20I"&gt;Kabinet Ali Sastroamidjojo I&lt;/a&gt;) uga &lt;a href="1956"&gt;1956&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1957"&gt;1957&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Kabinet%20Ali%20Sastroamidjojo%20II"&gt;Kabinet Ali Sastroamidjojo II&lt;/a&gt;).
Banjur,panjenengané uga pernah njabat minangka Wakil &lt;a href="Prat%C3%A9lan%20Mantri%20Komunikasi%20lan%20Informatika%20R%C3%A9publik%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Mantri Panerangan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Kabinet%20Presidensial%20I"&gt;Kabinet Presidensial I&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prat%C3%A9lan%20Mantri%20Pendhidhikan%20Nasional%20R%C3%A9publik%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Mantri Pengajaran&lt;/a&gt; pada &lt;a href="Kabinet%20Amir%20Sjarifuddin%20I"&gt;Kabinet Amir Sjarifuddin I&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabinet%20Amir%20Sjarifuddin%20II"&gt;Amir Sjarifuddin II&lt;/a&gt;, sarta &lt;a href="Kabinet%20Hatta%20I"&gt;Hatta I&lt;/a&gt;, lan Wakil Ketua &lt;a href="MPRS"&gt;MPRS&lt;/a&gt; sajeroning &lt;a href="Kabinet%20Kerja%20III"&gt;Kabinet Kerja III&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabinet%20Kerja%20IV"&gt;Kerja IV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabinet%20Dwikora%20I"&gt;Dwikora I&lt;/a&gt;, uga &lt;a href="Kabinet%20Dwikora%20II"&gt;Dwikora II&lt;/a&gt;.
