<doc id="74692" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=74692" title="George H. W. Bush">
George H. W. Bush

George Herbert Walker Bush (#ALIH), utawa kerep diundang déning médhia kanthi sebutan Bush Senior kanggo mbedakake karo &lt;a href="George%20Walker%20Bush"&gt;anaknya&lt;/a&gt; kang uga dadi &lt;a href="pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n"&gt;présidhèn&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Présidhèn Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kaping 41 mangsa kalungguhan &lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;–&lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt;. Sadurungé dadi présidhèn, Bush dadi &lt;a href="Wakil%20Pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;wakil présidhèn&lt;/a&gt; kaping 43 ana ing pamaréntahane &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Présidhèn&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ronald%20Reagan"&gt;Ronald Reagan&lt;/a&gt;.
George Bush Sr. yaiku anaké senator &lt;a href="Prescott%20Sheldon%20Bush"&gt;Prescott Sheldon Bush&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dorothy%20Walker%20Bush"&gt;Dorothy Walker Bush&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké lair ing &lt;a href="Milton%2C%20Massachusetts"&gt;Milton, Massachusetts&lt;/a&gt; lan omah-omah ing &lt;a href="Greenwich%2C%20Connecticut"&gt;Greenwich, Connecticut&lt;/a&gt;. Sadurungé dadi présidhèn, Bush wis kaping 43 dadi &lt;a href="Wakil%20Pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Wakil Présidhèn Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ngampingi Présidhèn &lt;a href="Ronald%20Reagan"&gt;Ronald Reagan&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké yaiku anggota Konggrès saka &lt;a href="Texas"&gt;Texas&lt;/a&gt; (1967–1971), &lt;a href="Duta%20Besar"&gt;Duta Besar&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="Perserikatan%20Bangsa-bangsa"&gt;PBB&lt;/a&gt; (1971–1973), Ketua Pimpinan Nasional &lt;a href="Part%C3%A9%20R%C3%A9publik"&gt;Parté Républik&lt;/a&gt; (1973–1974), Kepala Kantor Penghubung Amérika Sarékat kanggo &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Rakyat%20Cina"&gt;Républik Rakyat Cina&lt;/a&gt; (1974–1976), lan Direktur &lt;a href="Central%20Intelligence%20Agency"&gt;CIA&lt;/a&gt; (1976–1977).
Bush yaiku bapake présidhèn &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kaping 43, &lt;a href="George%20Walker%20Bush"&gt;George Walker Bush&lt;/a&gt; lan Gubernur &lt;a href="Florida"&gt;Florida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jeb%20Bush"&gt;Jeb Bush&lt;/a&gt;.
