<doc id="74872" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=74872" title="Ban">
Ban

Ban ya iku &lt;a href="piranti"&gt;piranti&lt;/a&gt; kang nutupi &lt;a href="velg"&gt;velg&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="rodha"&gt;rodha&lt;/a&gt;. Ban kalebu pérangan wigati saka &lt;a href="wahana"&gt;wahana&lt;/a&gt; dahrat. Ban gunané kanggo ngurangi getaran kang disebabaké dalan kang ora alus utawa akèh jeglongané. Saliyané iku ban uga kena kanggo njaga rodha lan ndadékaké rodha ora gampang &lt;a href="aus"&gt;aus&lt;/a&gt; lan rusak. Ban uga bisa njaga kestabilan anatarané kendaraan karo lemah saéngga gampang anggoné obah lan ngundhakaké percepatan.
Akéh-akéhé ban mligi kang minangka &lt;a href="kendaraan%20bermotor"&gt;kendaraan bermotor&lt;/a&gt;, digawé saka &lt;a href="kar%C3%A8t%20sintetik"&gt;karèt sintetik&lt;/a&gt;, nanging ana uga kang digawé saka bahan liyané kaya ta &lt;a href="waja"&gt;waja&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah ban</h2>
Sajarah ban.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="1839"&gt;1839&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Charles%20Goodyear"&gt;Charles Goodyear&lt;/a&gt; bisa nemu &lt;a href="t%C3%A9knik"&gt;téknik&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="vulkanisasi"&gt;vulkanisasi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kar%C3%A8t"&gt;karèt&lt;/a&gt;. Vulkanisasi iki asalé saka tembung &lt;a href="Vulkan"&gt;Vulkan&lt;/a&gt; kang tegesé &lt;a href="d%C3%A9wa%20api"&gt;déwa api&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="agama"&gt;agama&lt;/a&gt; wong &lt;a href="Romawi"&gt;Romawi&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging &lt;a href="Goodyear"&gt;Goodyear&lt;/a&gt; ora jenengi penemuané iku kanthi jeneng vulkanisasi nanging karét kang tahan &lt;a href="geni"&gt;geni&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng Goddyear banjur diabadiaké dadi jeneng perusahaan karét kang misuwur ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ya iku &lt;a href="Goodyear"&gt;Goodyear Tire and Rubber company&lt;/a&gt;. Perusahaan iki dibangun karo &lt;a href="Frank%20Seiberling"&gt;Frank Seiberling&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1898"&gt;1898&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Goodyear%20Tire%20%26amp%3B%20Rubber%20Company"&gt;Goodyear Tire &amp; Rubber Company&lt;/a&gt; wiwit dibangun taun 1898 nalika &lt;a href="Frank%20Seiberling"&gt;Frank Seiberling&lt;/a&gt; tuku pabrik kang sepisanan &lt;a href="perusahaan"&gt;perusahaan&lt;/a&gt; iki. Dhèwèké nggunakaké dhuwit siléhan saka ipéné.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="1845"&gt;1845&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Robert%20William%20Thomson"&gt;Thomson&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="John%20Boyd%20Dunlop"&gt;Dunlop&lt;/a&gt; nciptakaké ban kang nalika semana diarani ban urip tegesé ban kang duwé gronggongan udara. Kanthi penemuan iki &lt;a href="Thomson"&gt;Thomson&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dunlop"&gt;Dunlop&lt;/a&gt; diarani &lt;a href="Bapak%20Ban"&gt;Bapak Ban&lt;/a&gt;. Kanthi ngrembakané &lt;a href="t%C3%A9knologi"&gt;téknologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Charles%20Kingston%20Welch"&gt;Charles Kingston Welch&lt;/a&gt; nemu ban njero, déné &lt;a href="William%20Erskine%20Bartlett"&gt;William Erskine Bartlett&lt;/a&gt; nemu ban njaba.
