<li>Thunnus maccoyii, &lt;a href="tatihu"&gt;tatihu&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Thunnus obesus, &lt;a href="tuna%20mata%20besar"&gt;tuna mata besar&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Thunnus orientalis, &lt;a href="tuna%20sirip%20biru%20Pasifik"&gt;tuna sirip biru Pasifik&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Thunnus thynnus, &lt;a href="tuna%20sirip%20biru"&gt;tuna sirip biru&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
