<doc id="75046" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=75046" title="Snoopy">
Snoopy

Snoopy ya iku tokoh &lt;a href="fiksi"&gt;fiksi&lt;/a&gt; kang wujud &lt;a href="asu"&gt;asu&lt;/a&gt; jinis &lt;a href="beagle"&gt;beagle&lt;/a&gt; kang diingoni &lt;a href="Charlie%20Brown"&gt;Charlie Brown&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="strip%20komik"&gt;strip komik&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Peanuts"&gt;Peanuts&lt;/a&gt; kang digawé &lt;a href="Charles%20M.%20Schulz"&gt;Charles M. Schulz&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika rong taun sawisé tokoh Snoopy dikenal, tokoh Snoopy mung digambaraké dadi asu biyasa, nanging sangsaya suwé Snoopy dadi karakter kang bisa ngomong.&lt;a href="Balon%20teks"&gt;Balon teks&lt;/a&gt; Snoopy isiné babagan apa kang dipikiraké snoopy, saéngga Snoopy bisa ngomong.
Asu kang diingoni &lt;a href="Schulz"&gt;Schulz&lt;/a&gt; nalika isih cilik, &lt;a href="Snooky"&gt;Snooky&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Spike"&gt;Spike&lt;/a&gt; didadékaké &lt;a href="modh%C3%A9l"&gt;modhél&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="tokoh"&gt;tokoh&lt;/a&gt; Snoopy. &lt;a href="Produser"&gt;Produser&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="animasi"&gt;animasi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bill%20Melendez"&gt;Bill Melendez&lt;/a&gt; ngisi &lt;a href="swara"&gt;swara&lt;/a&gt; Snoopy lan uga &lt;a href="Woodstock%20%28Peanuts%29"&gt;Woodstock&lt;/a&gt; ing filem animasi kang digawé kanggo acara spesial ing &lt;a href="tivi"&gt;tivi&lt;/a&gt; wiwit taun &lt;a href="1965"&gt;1965&lt;/a&gt; nganti &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Snoopy sepisanan digawé tanggal &lt;a href="4%20Oktober"&gt;4 Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1950"&gt;1950&lt;/a&gt; (dina kaping 3 nalika digawene strip komik Peanuts kang sepisanan). Nanging Snoopy lagi diwénéhi keneng nalika tanggal &lt;a href="10%20November"&gt;10 November&lt;/a&gt; ya iku ing sasi mburine. Snoopy wiwitané arep diwénéhi jeneng "Sniffy" Jeneng &lt;a href="Sniffy"&gt;Sniffy&lt;/a&gt; wis dianggo ing strip komik liyané.
Ing filem animasi, babagan kang dipikiraké Snoopy uga ora diterangaké nganggo omongan utawa tembung-tembung, nanging nganggo obahan lan èksprèsi kaya déné &lt;a href="pantomim"&gt;pantomim&lt;/a&gt;. Film mirunggan &lt;a href="You%27re%20a%20Good%20Man%2C%20Charlie%20Brown%20%28filem%20televisi%29"&gt;You're a Good Man, Charlie Brown&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="Snoopy%21%21%21%20The%20Musical%20%28filem%20televisi%29"&gt;Snoopy!!! The Musical&lt;/a&gt; kalebu filem mirunggan awit ing filem iki Snoopy bisa ngomong. Nalika iku kang ngisi swara ya iku &lt;a href="Robert%20Towers"&gt;Robert Towers&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Cam%20Clarke"&gt;Cam Clarke&lt;/a&gt;.
Identitas Snoopy minangka kirik &lt;a href="beagle"&gt;beagle&lt;/a&gt; kang sepisanan dicithak ing strip &lt;a href="komik"&gt;komik&lt;/a&gt; nalika tanggal &lt;a href="5%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;5 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1960"&gt;1960&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika iku digambaraké Snoopy lagi turu. Saka gambar-gambar Snoopy kang paling dikenal ya iku gambar Snoopy lagi ngalamun dadi &lt;a href="penulis"&gt;penulis&lt;/a&gt;.
