<h2>Objek Panaliten</h2>
Objek Panaliten.
Gunung Gedhé kalebu gunung kang kas lan unik, amarga iku, Gunung Gedhé didadèkaké salah sijiné &lt;a href="laboratorium%20alam"&gt;laboratorium alam&lt;/a&gt; kang agawé para paneliti seneng karo Gunung Gedhé.
Ana ing taun &lt;a href="1819"&gt;1819&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="C.G.C.%20Reinwardt"&gt;C.G.C. Reinwardt&lt;/a&gt; wong kang kaping pisan bisa mendaki Gunung Gedhé, sateruse disusul déning &lt;a href="F.W.%20Junghuhn"&gt;F.W. Junghuhn&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1839"&gt;1839&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1861"&gt;1861&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Johannes%20Elias%20Teijsmann"&gt;J.E. Teijsmann&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1839"&gt;1839&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Alfred%20Russel%20Wallace"&gt;A.R. Wallace&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1861"&gt;1861&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="S.H.%20Koorders"&gt;S.H. Koorders&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1890"&gt;1890&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Melchior%20Treub"&gt;M. Treub&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1891"&gt;1891&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="W.M.%20Docters%20van%20Leeuwen"&gt;W.M. Docters van Leeuwen&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1911"&gt;1911&lt;/a&gt;); lan &lt;a href="C.G.G.J.%20van%20Steenis"&gt;C.G.G.J. van Steenis&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1920-1952"&gt;1920-1952&lt;/a&gt;) wis gawé warna-warna &lt;a href="wit"&gt;wit&lt;/a&gt;-witan kanggo dhasar nyusun buku The Mountain Flora of Java kang diterbitake taun &lt;a href="1972"&gt;1972&lt;/a&gt;.
Gunung Gedhé uga duwé warna-warna &lt;a href="%C3%A9kosistem"&gt;ékosistem&lt;/a&gt; yaiku &lt;a href="formasi%20alas"&gt;formasi-formasi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="alas"&gt;alas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="alas%20submontana"&gt;submontana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="alas%20montana"&gt;montana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="alas%20subalpin"&gt;subalpin&lt;/a&gt;; sarta ékosistem &lt;a href="tlaga"&gt;tlaga&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="rawa"&gt;rawa&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="savana"&gt;savana&lt;/a&gt;.
